                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Manifestation^^** within 6&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a banishment roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the banishment roll equals or exceeds the banishment value listed on the **^^Manifestation^^**&apos;s warscroll, inflict D3 mortal damage on the unit that summoned it. Then, the target is banished and removed from play.</characteristic>
