                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, if either target uses the &apos;All-out Defence&apos; command, the other target can also use the same command in the same phase and no command points are spent to use the command a second time.</characteristic>
